# Every file here is consumed by a Linux container. Git for Windows defaults to
# core.autocrlf=true, which checks scripts out with CRLF - a bind-mounted entrypoint then
# fails with "no such file or directory" (the \r is part of the interpreter path) and
# odoo.conf / *.properties get \r glued onto every value. Force LF regardless of host.
# text=auto still detects binaries (png, p12, war) and leaves them alone.
* text=auto eol=lf
